ons  along the superior inferior axis  of the biopsy cavity  entirely submitted   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab    labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  Scansaroli  REMOVE_MRN and  sentinel nodes  left breast   is a 5 x 2 x 0 7cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue containing 2 lymph nodes  both measuring 2cm in greatest dimension  Each is bisected and entirely frozen as FX 1 and FX 1A FX 1B  now submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 AND DEEPER  1 SENTINEL LYMPH NODE  BISECTED   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1A  1B  1 SENTINEL LYMPH NODE  BISECTED   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Adriana Dionigi Corben M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Breast  Left   Excision PART B  Lymph Node  Left Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART C  Cryostat Frozen Section  slide only   report_end  , Unchecked.
