ty has been previously opened  there is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm anterior defect  abutting the superior edge of the skin ellipse  The cavity is 0 5cm from the closest posterior margin and 0 6cm deep to the skin  The rest of the margins are  1 0cm from the cavity  Adjacent to  but distinct from the first cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm hemorrhagic cavity which contains old blood and fibrin  located at 2 5cm away from the nipple at 5 o clock position  0 2cm from the posterior margin and 0 9cm from anterior margin  This cavity is also surrounded by fat necrosis and fibrous tissue  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is fibrofatty without any additional focal lesions  Sectioning of the axillary tail reveals 2 papable lymph nodes averaging REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  SECTION CODE A  Biopsy cavity to the anterior  posterior margins and skin surface  B C  Representative section of the biopsy cavity to the posterior  anterior margins and skin surface  D E  Representative sections of the biopsy cavity to anterior  posterior margins and skin surface  F  A representative section of the biopsy cavity to anterior margin and skin surface  G K  Representative sections of the smaller cavity to the posterior  and anterior margins  L M  Representative sections of breast tissue away from the biopsy cavity from the medial aspect of the specimen  N O  Representative sections of the breast tissue away from the biopsy cavity from the lateral aspect of the specimen  P  Representative sections of the breast tissue away from the biopsy cavity from the superior aspect of the specimen  Q  Representative section of the breast tissue away from the biopsy cavity from the inferior aspect of the specimen  R  Axillary lymph nodes  bisected  S  Representative section of the nipple  Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Isa