ellow foci  The remainder of the tissue  approximately 85   consists of adipose tissue with the remaining tissue being soft  white fibrous tissue  The lesion is entirely submitted as A D from the superior to the inferior aspect  Additional sections are submitted as follows  E  Superior end  F  Inferior end  Received in saline   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue  183   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm lymph node  The cut surfaces are soft and tan  The specimen is trisected and entirely submitted as G H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margins  medial half of cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm unoriented  irregular portion of fibrofatty tissue  with thermal change  On sectioning no masses or nodules are grossly identified  The tissue consists mainly of soft  white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as I and J  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin  lateral half of cavity   are two unoriented irregular portions of fibrofatty tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The portions demonstrate thermal artifact  On sectioning no masses or nodules are grossly identified  The tissue is blue dyed stained  The tissue consists of approximately 45  soft  white fibrous tissue  the specimen is entirely submitted as K N  Gross Description by  TIM J  ROBINSON Resident  RANIA M  SELIEM  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE RIGHT SENTINEL  183  EXCISION PART C  BREAST RIGHT SHAVED MARGIN MEDIAL REMOVED_DATE OF CAVITY  E PART D  BREAST RIGHT SHAVED MARGIN LATERAL REMOVED_DATE OF CAVITY   , Unchecked.
