IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  blocks N and FF   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells show moderate  2   in blocK FF and strong  3   in block N overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  06 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 09 04 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of breast tissue with a long suture designating medial and a short suture designating superior  There is a localizing wire in place  The accompanying radiograph discloses calcification  The specimen is black inked  superior is red inked  posterior is blue inked and inferior is orange inked  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a 60  dense white fibrous to 40  yellow lobulated fatty tissue  A discrete mass is not evident  Representative sections are submitted in sequential fashion from medial to lateral as A K and more representative sections are submitted as BB GG  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right axillary sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm fatty rubbery tan red lymph node which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as L O  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right axillary non sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm fatty tan red rubbery lymph node which is trisected and entirely submitted as P R  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  medial shaving right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of yellow breast tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as S T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  superior shaving  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of yellow breast tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as V X  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  inferior shaving  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of yellow breast tissue which is entirely submitted as Y AA  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  WEN JING  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL   PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  NON SENTINEL    EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT   MEDIAL MARGIN PART E  BREAST  RIGHT   SUPERIOR MARGIN PART F  BREAST  RIGHT   INFERIOR MARGIN   report_end  , Unchecked.
