e  This fibrous tissue approaches the posterior  lateral  and superior margins  The specimen is approximately 80  fibrous and 20  fatty  No biopsy cavity or tumor are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  Posterior margin  C  Superior margin  D  Inferior margin  E  Anterior margin  F  Lateral margin  G  Medial margin  H K  Representative of fibrous tissue  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fibro fatty breast tissue  which is entirely submitted in cassettes L R  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary contents   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of adipose tissue within which are multiple tan yellow lymph nodes ranging from 0 2cm to 3 0cm in greatest dimension  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted as follows  S DD  Whole lymph nodes EE GG  Representative sectins of lymph nodes  Gross Description by  SHANNON SCHUTZ Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT BREAST LUMP   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGINS    EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
